  "description": "Gunko Street is a daring 3D graffiti font. This typeface seizes street culture’s spirit with its dynamic strokes, sharp edges, and enthralling shadow effect. It’s an ideal choice for streetwear emblem designs, hip-hop event promotional content, merchandise graphics, or high-impact headlines. Gunko Street font crafts your text with a layered 3D effect, adding depth and motion for a unique, edgy tone. Its application is versatile, from vibrant music album covers to compelling marketing graphics, rendering an authentic graffiti aesthetic enhanced with a contemporary spin. Gunko Street is inherently bold, ensuring your message makes a statement while prioritizing readability across both digital and physical mediums. Included files: Gunko Street in the OTF and TTF formats.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Gunko Street is a daring 3D graffiti font. </strong>This typeface seizes street culture’s spirit with its dynamic strokes, sharp edges, and enthralling shadow effect. It’s an ideal choice for streetwear emblem designs, hip-hop event promotional content, merchandise graphics, or high-impact headlines<strong>. Gunko Street font</strong> crafts your text with a layered 3D effect, adding depth and motion for a unique, edgy tone. Its application is versatile, from vibrant music album covers to compelling marketing graphics, rendering an authentic graffiti aesthetic enhanced with a contemporary spin. <strong>Gunko Street</strong> is inherently bold, ensuring your message makes a statement while prioritizing readability across both digital and physical mediums. Included files: <strong>Gunko Street </strong>in the OTF and TTF formats.</p>",
